{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8e6bbf933ac8b7dd30e6966a590d17ecf7d5eaa6cc2d99622d0cea1fa99d0814",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc84f7cd7f0196af6ca52359d13fb03c8ded564899495ec7477e3efbb20992e6",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25751d21eca48a41a279e213c65f9ea352d2adec4d0bb62cfb03d22750dbe87d",
      "text": "在早间新闻节目里听到了我们的歌，\n听着听着就想找你说说话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796e810487ff1ff91511dd684263bf3d21e7b22620e1b6c0fe1e0d21ce746013",
      "text": "我出演的那一天，\n光是应付眼前的工作就竭尽全力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95439c0415f565bb2ffa07f8b176e1dd9a806d01e1454929798e4705543db461",
      "text": "但是，在任务完成的现在，\n我切实感受到了自己作为偶像成长了一圈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cbee7dd1215553f8351ebc70c7c48254aacde36d463a25409d1dbf6ef35c83d",
      "text": "不过……每天早上电视里都会播放我们唱的歌，\n感觉还真是不可思议啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:869eb7b7d6b996e66138ab2a4e6f3f805af188b51590d4a52e8b3fb5534eec3e",
      "text": "迟早有一天会变成家常便饭的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31c1fcaebaec6af04c1355add0d8581f722ec73820ff82e4784bc7babc4bc40e",
      "text": "哈哈，说得也是。我们作为偶像的活动，\n也才刚刚起步而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9dc313994e3f6fe7a2aec7bfcc36c68ddcfcdf2ff3d7553c211b895a6a832d1",
      "text": "朝着让那一切变成理所当然的那一天，\n继续成长吧。今后也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28b891767cf6faf8bf6bdfb0daaee5c5e8d63795701242bcfddc0042a93b1088",
      "text": "我才要拜托您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_302_2_3_016_02_09_a:2_3_016_02_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79a9bbd7936ba8e82de760cf626a5b797f308e716aecaa697d04453a8f3fd2c4",
      "text": "嗯。大清早给你打电话真是不好意思。\n那么，待会儿事务所见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
